WEBVTT

00:00:02.581 --> 00:00:07.385
A tablet on the handlebars, a laptop cast to the wall: fill the screen from any

00:00:07.385 --> 00:00:07.989
page.

00:00:10.324 --> 00:00:15.126
The race had no Full screen button. Now it sits at the end of the bar, and in full

00:00:15.126 --> 00:00:17.359
screen it reads Exit full screen.

00:00:23.228 --> 00:00:28.098
The class ride, Class Start, Race Setup, Results and Connect Bike gain it too: every

00:00:28.098 --> 00:00:29.673
header the mocks draw.

00:00:36.133 --> 00:00:41.339
Where the browser has no Fullscreen API, no header offers it. The custom ride and

00:00:41.339 --> 00:00:43.631
workout used to show it anyway.

00:00:49.038 --> 00:00:53.850
Fourteen screens, each pressed in and out, and each checked without the API.

00:00:59.361 --> 00:01:01.903
Race Setup, from a phone to the full screen.

00:01:09.685 --> 00:01:14.288
Telo Ride, from the Telo family, turns a smart bike at home into a game.

00:01:14.633 --> 00:01:19.145
It pairs with the bike over Bluetooth, reads your power and sets resistance for

00:01:19.145 --> 00:01:20.816
every hill and interval.

00:01:21.161 --> 00:01:26.339
Two doors: Race (ride a map against your best-time ghost, bots or people) and

00:01:26.339 --> 00:01:31.787
Classes (ride along to a video, alone or with a group), fed by one progression of

00:01:31.787 --> 00:01:34.777
XP, rider levels, stars and map unlocks.

00:01:35.123 --> 00:01:37.615
A custom workout lives under Profile.
